 # Project rules
 
 This project declares no rules beyond its README.
+
+## Decisions taken
+
+- Cancellation (`cancel(bookingId, at)`): full refund of the booking total if `at` is before the rental
+  start, no refund from the start on. Assumed, not specified by the school; change in one place if the
+  policy differs.
